    "trigger_word": "traffic",
    "trigger_card_number": 401,
    "header_color": "cyan",
    "title": "第46课：虚拟过去",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "第三条件句用来设想一个",
          "未曾发生的过去及其结果。",
          "",
          "结构：if + had done，",
          "would have done：",
          "“If you had left earlier, you would",
          "have missed the traffic.”",
          "（但你没早点出发，所以遇上了堵车。）",
          "",
          "两部分都是虚拟的。if 从句用",
          "had done；主句用",
          "would have done。",
          "",
          "许多语言在两部分使用同一种语气；",
          "而英语则搭配使用",
          "had done 和",
          "would have done。"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "047",
    "trigger_word": "miracle",
    "trigger_card_number": 442,
    "header_color": "cyan",
    "title": "第47课：愿望与遗憾",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 1,
        "content": [
          "wish + had done 表达对无法改变",
          "的过去的遗憾。",
          "",
          "  I wish I had known. （但其实不知，",
          "     现在感到后悔。）",
          "",
          "if only 表达同样愿望，但语气更强：",
          "  If only he had taken the pill.",
          "To undo it now would take a miracle.",
          "",
          "动词形式退回到 had + done ——",
          "和第三条件句中 if 从句",
          "所用的形式相同。",
          "",
          "许多语言用专门的“但愿”类词",
          "表达这种遗憾；英语则将 wish",
          "与 had + done 搭配使用。"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "lesson_id": "048",
    "trigger_word": "internet",
    "trigger_card_number": 508,
    "header_color": "cyan",
    "title": "第48课：间接引语",
    "pages": [
      {
        "page": 1,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "转述疑问句时，不能保留原问句语序。",
          "",
          "  \"Where do you live?\"",
          "  She asked me where I lived.",
          "",
          "语序变为陈述句形式（where I LIVED，",
          "而非 where DID I live），且时态后退一步。",
          "",
          "是非问句用 whether 或 if 引导：",
          "  \"Is the internet down?\"",
          "  He asked me whether the internet was",
          "  down."
        ]
      },
      {
        "page": 2,
        "total_pages": 2,
        "content": [
          "转述命令或请求时，用",
          "tell/ask someone + to + verb。",
          "",
          "  \"Turn it off.\"",
          "  She told me to turn it off.",
          "",
          "  \"Please wait.\"",
          "  He asked me to wait.",
          "",
          "否定命令在 to 前加 not：",
          "  \"Don't touch it.\"",
          "  They told me not to touch it.",
          "",
          "许多语言逐字引用说话内容；英语则会",
          "调整结构——语序变平，时态后退，",
          "命令转为“to do”形式。"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
